                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The guy who says this is a mobile port has no idea what he's talking about.\n\nAs a Kickstarter backer for more than $30, I got to play this in beta. The game's graphics and animations are a bit rough, but the gameplay itself is fantastic. The Logic Dreams guys made a stand-out hit, and the mix of planning at the strategic level (through trading, supply lines, and etc) as well as the flexible tactics make for a fun and challenging game, if not exactly historically accurate.\n\nHooray!",
